{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06P7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$G \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$G_B$", "MATH_0004": "$B$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-group-space}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c2fd7af9022d6a02e01c9e2d204ec0901e1bdc2e4f6626bad18781314b10f2df", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0201b3161ee7c4047150c757720395a83e163e795060c56de26db370412a92fa", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIf <MATH_0001> is a group scheme over the base scheme <MATH_0002>, then the base\nchange <MATH_0003> to any algebraic space <MATH_0004> over <MATH_0005> is an group algebraic\nspace over <MATH_0006> by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nWe will frequently use this in the examples below.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bfe8ea1e8d81c0650c981fce7f8d821ce9ea01d7570c9f139405ed177391a394", "unit_id": "tag:06P7:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "example", "parent_tag": "06P7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$T$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Gamma(T, \\mathcal{O}_T^*)$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\mathbf{G}_{m, B} = B \\times_S \\mathbf{G}_{m, S}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$B$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathbf{G}_{m, S}$", "MATH_0008": "$S$", "OWNARGEND_0001": "]\n\\label{example-multiplicative-group}\n", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{groupoids-example-multiplicative-group}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{example}[", "suffix": "\\end{example}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2f2f0f1943af9c092c6193d37eecab6c212bf2ee6f7a87370e33a2133feb1423", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:88f7283c8b7c5a8badf4d35a2d6e44d0c7b9acef64e37c8447544c42da499978", "source_text": "Multiplicative group algebraic space<OWNARGEND_0001>Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nConsider the functor which associates to any scheme <MATH_0002> over\n<MATH_0003> the group <MATH_0004>\nof units in the global sections of the structure sheaf.\nThis is representable by the group algebraic space\n<MATH_0005>\nover <MATH_0006>. Here <MATH_0007> is the multiplicative group scheme\nover <MATH_0008>, see\nGroupoids, Example <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:00bf6f6bec232e12044527703dc59eed3a5ac868ffd135fc78d76a8c114c4e0f", "unit_id": "tag:043J:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "example", "parent_tag": "06P7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$n \\in \\mathbf{N}$", "MATH_0003": "$T$", "MATH_0004": "$B$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Gamma(T, \\mathcal{O}_T^*)$", "MATH_0006": "$n$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\mu_{n, B} = B \\times_S \\mu_{n, S}\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$B$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mu_{n, S}$", "MATH_0010": "$n$", "MATH_0011": "$S$", "OWNARGEND_0001": "]\n\\label{example-roots-of-unity}\n", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{groupoids-example-roots-of-unity}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{example}[", "suffix": "\\end{example}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:40e798aa7a10b444468582253a7fe41aac9a719a6c25ce1f74823b4e4be9473e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e454ef5e1b9f4ef086a5d1c0e9264a7e882503fd596b2095e890b94f372867b3", "source_text": "Roots of unity as a group algebraic space<OWNARGEND_0001>Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002>. Consider the functor which associates\nto any scheme <MATH_0003> over <MATH_0004> the subgroup of <MATH_0005>\nconsisting of <MATH_0006>th roots of unity.\nThis is representable by the group algebraic space\n<MATH_0007>\nover <MATH_0008>. Here <MATH_0009> is the group scheme of <MATH_0010>th roots of\nunity over <MATH_0011>, see\nGroupoids, Example <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d9f5a5a197166a979c96ffd9eeada69ed302e26bc28140eaccf5df223a7b6332", "unit_id": "tag:043K:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "example", "parent_tag": "06P7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$T$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Gamma(T, \\mathcal{O}_T)$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\mathbf{G}_{a, B} = B \\times_S \\mathbf{G}_{a, S}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$B$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathbf{G}_{a, S}$", "MATH_0008": "$S$", "OWNARGEND_0001": "]\n\\label{example-additive-group}\n", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{groupoids-example-additive-group}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{example}[", "suffix": "\\end{example}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:83ead73bb99c2705c21de1a9034e4697057aee630a72db92458ecc9b36d9fe81", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4895e71478c749f57f4a01a05f7f602df87c9df103ef7dce920630a5ddabda70", "source_text": "Additive group algebraic space<OWNARGEND_0001>Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nConsider the functor which associates\nto any scheme <MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003> the group <MATH_0004>\nof global sections of the structure sheaf.\nThis is representable by the group algebraic space\n<MATH_0005>\nover <MATH_0006>. Here <MATH_0007> is the additive group scheme\nover <MATH_0008>, see\nGroupoids, Example <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:57e85ebd6f11a1c93acecbf8bdb8234942a4c960bf41ae7f25cbb20573d2cf39", "unit_id": "tag:043L:statement"}
